<view class="page"><view>选择 UTF-8 CSV；列名：username,nickname,deptId,email,mobile,sex,status。每次最多 200 行。不会覆盖现有账号或分配角色。</view><button bindtap="choose" disabled="{{busy || uncertain}}">选择文件</button><view wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{result}}">{{result}}</view><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="index">{{item.username}} · {{item.nickname}} · 部门 {{item.deptId}} · 状态 {{item.status}}</view><button wx:if="{{rows.length && !previewed && !done}}" bindtap="preview" disabled="{{busy || uncertain}}">验证预览</button><button wx:if="{{previewed && !done}}" bindtap="confirm" disabled="{{busy || uncertain}}">确认导入</button><view wx:if="{{uncertain}}">结果未知，请先到账号列表核对，再重新进入。</view></view>
